# World -1 tour, for `NATHAN_MINUS_ONE=1 scripts/record-run --capture` (format:
# src/capture/timeline.rs). The arrival crash; picking spikes turns all the ground into
# toilet brushes (splat); a clean restart; then a mid-toot pause off the ground block that
# blanks every ground tile, the goal's box with them.

# The arrival crash: the corrupted menu. Pick the spikes entry.
wait 1.6
tap Down
wait 1.2
tap Enter
wait 3.5

# Restart (clean), crash again, resume.
tap R
wait 1.6
tap Enter
wait 1.2

# Over to the ground block, hop on it.
hold Right 1.3
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 150ms
wait 0.6

# Jump, toot, pause mid-toot: the corrupted menu. Pick the blank entry.
hold Space 140ms
wait 120ms
tap Space
wait 100ms
tap Esc
wait 1.0
repeat 3
  tap Down
  wait 0.4
end
wait 0.4
tap Enter
wait 1.5

# Walk into the goal.
hold Right 2.5
wait 3
